# 31. Arthropod/exoskeletal

**BODY-005**

Components depend strongly on species.

Suggested regions:

- sensory/head;
- central thorax/core;
- abdomen;
- limbs;
- special appendages.

External shell uses ordinary natural Protection.

Damage beneath shell does not automatically reduce every limb.

