# 32. Amorphous

**BODY-006**

No standard humanoid location table applies.

Define:

- core structures if any;
- distributed function;
- locomotion medium;
- vulnerability to division;
- vulnerability to heat/cold/chemical effects.

A headshot has no special meaning unless the anatomy actually has a head.

